    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<div class="panel">
  <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:12px">
    <h1>🤖 {{ t('Mastermind', '操盘大脑') }}</h1>
    <span class="muted">{{ t('AI paper-trading desk — a daily snapshot of the live book', 'AI 模拟交易台 — 实盘账本每日快照') }}</span>
    <a class="live-btn" id="mm-live" href="http://localhost:8000" target="_blank" rel="noopener">↗ {{ t('Open live dashboard', '打开实时面板') }}</a>
  </div>
  <p class="muted sm" style="margin:10px 0 0">{{ t(
    'Mastermind is an autonomous AI paper-trading agent that runs on a local server. This page is a STATIC SNAPSHOT of its dashboard, pushed twice a day. For the full interactive view — live marks, brain reasoning trace, research feed and order tickets — open the live dashboard (it runs on your local machine). Paper-only / display-only: accountability, not alpha. Not investment advice.',
    'Mastermind 是运行在本地服务器上的自主 AI 模拟交易代理。本页为其面板的静态快照，每日推送两次。如需完整交互视图——实时报价、推理追踪、研究动态与下单——请打开实时面板（运行于你的本机）。仅纸面／仅展示：问责而非阿尔法。非投资建议。') }}</p>
</div>

<div class="mm-tabs" id="mm-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Book · 账本"></div>

<div id="mm-root">
  <div class="panel mm-empty">{{ t('Loading the latest Mastermind snapshot…', '正在加载最新的 Mastermind 快照…') }}</div>
</div>

<div class="panel">
  <p class="muted" style="font-size:12px;margin:0" id="mm-foot">{{ t(
    'Static snapshot of a local AI paper-trading desk — refreshed twice daily. Paper-only / display-only; not investment advice.',
    '本地 AI 模拟交易台的静态快照 — 每日刷新两次。仅纸面／仅展示；非投资建议。') }}</p>
</div>

<script src="theme.js"></script>
<script src="mastermind.js"></script>
<footer class="site-footer">
  <span class="made">© 2026 Mastermind Inc</span>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
